<title>USA: Essential Resources effects stock split.</title>
<headline>Essential Resources effects stock split.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ORANGE, N.J. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Essential Resources Inc said on Monday that it effected its two-for-one forward split of its common stock, the record date of which was August 26, 1996.</p>
<p>Essential Resources is a developer and global distributor of natural health products.</p>
